{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage a business on a paradise island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your beach resort. Welcome guests, make them happy, earn money and invest in expanding your island. Stock your restaurant, offer activities, hire staff, level up to grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>You are the manager of a little paradise.</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf79Prepare local dishes and cocktails</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fresh produce on the island and cook delicious meals for your customers. Fruits, fish, chicken, turn into refined dishes thanks to a range of cooking furniture. Unlock levels to get faster utensils!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9c1bd0c0fce90b6a3d1beeaf54367087.poster.avif?t=1773221006\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9c1bd0c0fce90b6a3d1beeaf54367087.webm?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9c1bd0c0fce90b6a3d1beeaf54367087.mp4?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Install and maintain tourist activities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the simple towel to the biggest slides: Watch your customers relax or have fun during their vacation in one of the many activities you offer them. Level up, earn money, and unlock all activities. Maintain them, as they wear out over time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/06a59179ea542692f9eb84ba2283a7e3.poster.avif?t=1773221006\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/06a59179ea542692f9eb84ba2283a7e3.webm?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/06a59179ea542692f9eb84ba2283a7e3.mp4?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc20 Hire staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need help, hire a maintenance worker, a cashier and a cook for the day or longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/4d05324caf5e797ccf12870fc7e14d5e.poster.avif?t=1773221006\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/4d05324caf5e797ccf12870fc7e14d5e.webm?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/4d05324caf5e797ccf12870fc7e14d5e.mp4?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Co-op up to 4 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together and share the management of your island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/ca2e8b5b68856ff7fd63be0542fc3f0c.poster.avif?t=1773221006\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/ca2e8b5b68856ff7fd63be0542fc3f0c.webm?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/ca2e8b5b68856ff7fd63be0542fc3f0c.mp4?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf9 Clean the island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up, clear, make room and restore a lost paradise to its glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9879451406cc03225f0a206982a4764e.poster.avif?t=1773221006\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9879451406cc03225f0a206982a4764e.webm?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/9879451406cc03225f0a206982a4764e.mp4?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is full of resources, get on your jetski and explore the region in search of mysteries, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/e9d4808359c13cfd7102f774bbf2036a.poster.avif?t=1773221006\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/e9d4808359c13cfd7102f774bbf2036a.webm?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936190/extras/e9d4808359c13cfd7102f774bbf2036a.mp4?t=1773221006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Paradise Beach !","path":"https://